{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong> is a hypnotic 2D arcade rhythm challenge where you control a bouncing ball in a dazzlingly colorful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm is your guide:</strong> Jump up to the beat of a powerful soundtrack. The music isn't just background; it's the pulse of the game, guiding you when to act.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful chaos:</strong> Break through a kaleidoscope of ever-changing obstacles. You'll face an explosion of colors and new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect control:</strong> All you need is a cool head and a single click. Tap to jump upwards. Skillfully maneuver between traps, moving blocks, and narrow passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless drive:</strong> Fight for a place on the leaderboards. How many meters can you conquer before gravity takes over?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual ecstasy:</strong> Simple yet juicy graphics create a unique feeling of total immersion in this shimmering world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147220?t=1763006131","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147220?t=1763006131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147220/a49da017fca28f2a621b51acfd7591315b282033/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763006131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147220/a49da017fca28f2a621b51acfd7591315b282033/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763006131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{